abstract: >-
  NOX is a sovereign containment and assurance framework for long-horizon
  agentic intelligence risk. It develops architecture-level mechanisms for
  containment, verification, governance, deterministic intervention, decision
  provenance, and operational assurance in potentially hostile or
  non-aligned agentic systems.
